## Where specs and QA evidence live

- Filled EPIC/Story/Task specs (instances, not templates): `docs/tasks/epic-<NN>-<slug>.md`, following `ai-office/task-intake.md`.
- Tester's gameplay screenshot evidence: `qa-artifacts/<task-id>/` (git-ignored — ephemeral QA evidence, not a build artifact to commit).
